# keybind-find's e2e lfrc (synthetic). e2e-live quits, so a pick of shift+y ends the case; Y is bound only when lf
# runs on-init, so only the running lf's answer has it (the live read). The rest exercises keys keybind-find leaves
# out: a count digit, a bind after a shorter one (Qa after Q).
cmd e2e-live quit
nmap X quit
map 1 bottom
map Q quit
map Qa top
cmap <a-x> cmd-escape
cmd on-init :{{
    nmap Y e2e-live
    &true
}}
